   "name": "intella/custom-section",
   "attrs": {
    "label": "B2B ads have a harder job",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--cream\" aria-labelledby=\"h-335\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-head section-head--center\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"h-335\">B2B ads have <span class=\"accent\">a harder job</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">Pick a challenge to see how we handle it.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpvt cmvt\" data-tabs>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wpvt__list\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"B2B advertising challenges\" aria-orientation=\"vertical\"><button class=\"wpvt__tab cmvt__tab cmvt__tab--1\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"bh-334-t-quality\" aria-controls=\"bh-334-quality\" aria-selected=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b><i aria-hidden=\"true\">01</i>Leads sales won’t call</b><span>Forms fill up with students, job seekers and tiny companies.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</button><button class=\"wpvt__tab cmvt__tab cmvt__tab--2\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"bh-334-t-cycle\" aria-controls=\"bh-334-cycle\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b><i aria-hidden=\"true\">02</i>Long sales cycles</b><span>Deals take months, so ads look expensive in the short term.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</button><button class=\"wpvt__tab cmvt__tab cmvt__tab--3\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"bh-334-t-committee\" aria-controls=\"bh-334-committee\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b><i aria-hidden=\"true\">03</i>Many people decide</b><span>The user, the manager, IT and finance all need convincing.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</button><button class=\"wpvt__tab cmvt__tab cmvt__tab--4\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"bh-334-t-saas\" aria-controls=\"bh-334-saas\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b><i aria-hidden=\"true\">04</i>SaaS trials that never pay</b><span>Sign-ups arrive, but few activate or convert.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</button></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wpvt__panels\"><div class=\"wpvt__panel cmvt__panel cmvt__panel--1\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"bh-334-quality\" aria-labelledby=\"bh-334-t-quality\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__prob\"><span>The challenge</span>Forms fill up with students, job seekers and tiny companies.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__kick\">Our approach</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"cmvt__h\">Leads that match your ideal customer.</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__more\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__txt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>In B2B, one good lead is worth more than a hundred poor ones.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__sub\">In practice</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"cmvt__bul\" role=\"list\"><li>Ideal customer profile agreed with sales</li><li>Targeting by role and company</li><li>Forms that qualify</li><li>Outcomes fed back weekly</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__sub\">Why it matters</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Sales stops ignoring marketing leads.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"cmvt__fig\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"cmv cmv--calc\"><p class=\"cmv__t\">Leads by fit</p><ul class=\"cmv__rows\" role=\"list\"><li><span>Ideal fit</span><b>62%</b></li><li><span>Partial fit</span><b>28%</b></li><li><span>Poor fit</span><b>10%</b></li></ul></div></figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__label\">Methods we use</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol class=\"cmvt__ms\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">1</span><b>Targeting</b><p>Job titles, seniority and company size.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">2</span><b>Qualifying forms</b><p>Questions that filter out poor fits.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">3</span><b>CRM feedback</b><p>Sales outcomes sent back to the platforms.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">4</span><b>Negative audiences</b><p>Students, job seekers and competitors excluded.</p></li></ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__get\"><p>What you get</p><ul role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Better targeting</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Qualifying forms</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> CRM feedback</li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"wpvt__panel cmvt__panel cmvt__panel--2\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"bh-334-cycle\" aria-labelledby=\"bh-334-t-cycle\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__prob\"><span>The challenge</span>Deals take months, so ads look expensive in the short term.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__kick\">Our approach</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"cmvt__h\">Measure pipeline, not just leads.</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__more\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__txt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A campaign that costs more per lead can bring far more pipeline.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__sub\">In practice</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"cmvt__bul\" role=\"list\"><li>CRM stages tracked</li><li>Opportunities by campaign</li><li>Remarketing to open deals</li><li>Quarterly reviews</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__sub\">Why it matters</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Budget goes to campaigns that create deals.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"cmvt__fig\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"cmv cmv--calc\"><p class=\"cmv__t\">Pipeline by channel</p><ul class=\"cmv__rows\" role=\"list\"><li><span>Google search</span><b>$820K</b></li><li><span>LinkedIn</span><b>$610K</b></li><li><span>Meta</span><b>$90K</b></li></ul></div></figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__label\">Methods we use</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol class=\"cmvt__ms\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">1</span><b>Offline conversions</b><p>CRM stages sent to Google and LinkedIn.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">2</span><b>Pipeline reporting</b><p>Opportunities and revenue by campaign.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">3</span><b>Nurture</b><p>Remarketing during the sale.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">4</span><b>Patience</b><p>Budgets judged on the right timescale.</p></li></ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__get\"><p>What you get</p><ul role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Pipeline tracking</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Nurture campaigns</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Pipeline reports</li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"wpvt__panel cmvt__panel cmvt__panel--3\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"bh-334-committee\" aria-labelledby=\"bh-334-t-committee\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__prob\"><span>The challenge</span>The user, the manager, IT and finance all need convincing.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__kick\">Our approach</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"cmvt__h\">Reach the whole buying committee.</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__more\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__txt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Deals stall when one person isn’t convinced.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__sub\">In practice</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"cmvt__bul\" role=\"list\"><li>Target account lists</li><li>Ads for each role</li><li>Offers for each stage</li><li>Sales briefed</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__sub\">Why it matters</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Your champion isn’t selling alone.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"cmvt__fig\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"cmv cmv--calc\"><p class=\"cmv__t\">Target accounts</p><ul class=\"cmv__rows\" role=\"list\"><li><span>Reached</span><b>312 of 400</b></li><li><span>Engaged</span><b>96</b></li><li><span>Opportunities</span><b>18</b></li></ul></div></figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__label\">Methods we use</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol class=\"cmvt__ms\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">1</span><b>Account-based ads</b><p>Ads to target companies.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">2</span><b>Role-based messages</b><p>Different ads for each role.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">3</span><b>Content offers</b><p>Guides that answer each role’s questions.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">4</span><b>Sales alignment</b><p>Campaigns planned with sales.</p></li></ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__get\"><p>What you get</p><ul role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Account-based campaigns</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Role-based ads</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Content offers</li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"wpvt__panel cmvt__panel cmvt__panel--4\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"bh-334-saas\" aria-labelledby=\"bh-334-t-saas\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__prob\"><span>The challenge</span>Sign-ups arrive, but few activate or convert.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__kick\">Our approach</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"cmvt__h\">Optimise for activated and paying users.</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__more\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__txt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A cheap trial that never activates is the most expensive kind.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__sub\">In practice</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"cmvt__bul\" role=\"list\"><li>Activation events tracked</li><li>Trials scored by quality</li><li>Ads during the trial</li><li>Payback by channel</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__sub\">Why it matters</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Growth that pays back.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"cmvt__fig\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"cmv cmv--calc\"><p class=\"cmv__t\">Trials</p><ul class=\"cmv__rows\" role=\"list\"><li><span>Started</span><b>1,240</b></li><li><span>Activated</span><b>384</b></li><li><span>Paid</span><b>149</b></li></ul></div></figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__label\">Methods we use</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol class=\"cmvt__ms\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">1</span><b>Product events</b><p>Activation and payment sent to the platforms.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">2</span><b>Trial quality</b><p>Targeting that brings real users.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">3</span><b>Onboarding ads</b><p>Remarketing during the trial.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">4</span><b>Payback</b><p>Cost per paying user tracked.</p></li></ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__get\"><p>What you get</p><ul role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Activation tracking</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Trial remarketing</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Payback reports</li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
    "css": "b2b-performance-marketing",
    "modules": [
     "@intella/tabs"
    ]
   }
