    "label": "B2B companies we run ads for",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--white cmwk2s\" aria-labelledby=\"h-340\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-head section-head--center\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"h-340\">B2B companies we <span class=\"accent\">run ads for</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">Pick a company to see what we did.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2\" data-tabs>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"B2B clients\"><button class=\"cmwk2__tab cmwk2__tab--1\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"bw-339-t-vantage\" aria-controls=\"bw-339-vantage\" aria-selected=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"cmlg\" style=\"--lc:#0369a1\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 8h8l7 18 7-18h8L23 34h-6z\" fill=\"#0284c7\"/></svg><span class=\"cmlg__w\"><b>Vantage</b><span>Payroll</span></span></span><span class=\"cmwk2__ind\">B2B software</span>\n\t\t\t\t</button><button class=\"cmwk2__tab cmwk2__tab--2\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"bw-339-t-calder\" aria-controls=\"bw-339-calder\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"cmlg\" style=\"--lc:#be123c\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M8 32V8h8l4 10 4-10h8v24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e11d48\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"cmlg__w\"><b>Calder</b><span>Clinics</span></span></span><span class=\"cmwk2__ind\">Group of private clinics</span>\n\t\t\t\t</button><button class=\"cmwk2__tab cmwk2__tab--3\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"bw-339-t-packwise\" aria-controls=\"bw-339-packwise\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"cmlg\" style=\"--lc:#4338ca\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 4 34 12v16L20 36 6 28V12z\" fill=\"#6366f1\"/><path d=\"M6 12l14 8 14-8M20 20v16\" stroke=\"#c7d2fe\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\"/></svg><span class=\"cmlg__w\"><b>Packwise</b><span>Supplies</span></span></span><span class=\"cmwk2__ind\">Packaging, eCommerce and Amazon</span>\n\t\t\t\t</button></div>\n\t\t\t\t<article class=\"cmwk2__panel cmwk2__panel--1\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"bw-339-vantage\" aria-labelledby=\"bw-339-t-vantage\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<header class=\"cmwk2__head\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Vantage Payroll</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>B2B software · 90 people · 10 months with us</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"cmwk2__tags\" role=\"list\"><li>LinkedIn Ads</li><li>Google Ads</li><li>HubSpot</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t</header>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__grid\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__col cmwk2__col--why\"><p class=\"cmwk2__k\">Why they came to us</p><p>LinkedIn and Google brought plenty of leads, but sales said most were students and job seekers.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__col cmwk2__col--did\"><p class=\"cmwk2__k\">The work we did</p><ul class=\"cmwk2__did\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Qualifying questions on every form</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Offline conversions sent from HubSpot</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> LinkedIn audiences by job title and company size</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Landing pages for each audience</li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__col cmwk2__col--exp\"><p class=\"cmwk2__k\">The outcome they wanted</p><p>Fewer, better leads that sales would actually call.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__res\"><p class=\"cmwk2__k\">Results achieved</p><ul role=\"list\"><li><b>+140%</b><span>sales-qualified leads</span></li><li><b>−45%</b><span>cost per qualified lead</span></li><li><b>$1.6M</b><span>pipeline from ads</span></li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t</article><article class=\"cmwk2__panel cmwk2__panel--2\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"bw-339-calder\" aria-labelledby=\"bw-339-t-calder\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden>\n\t\t\t\t\t<header class=\"cmwk2__head\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Calder Clinics</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Group of private clinics · 6 locations · 18 months with us</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"cmwk2__tags\" role=\"list\"><li>Google Ads</li><li>Call tracking</li><li>Meta Ads</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t</header>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__grid\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__col cmwk2__col--why\"><p class=\"cmwk2__k\">Why they came to us</p><p>Google Ads was suspended twice, and phone bookings weren’t tracked at all.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__col cmwk2__col--did\"><p class=\"cmwk2__k\">The work we did</p><ul class=\"cmwk2__did\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Website fixes and a successful appeal</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Call tracking for every clinic</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Search campaigns by treatment</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Meta ads for new treatments</li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__col cmwk2__col--exp\"><p class=\"cmwk2__k\">The outcome they wanted</p><p>Steady bookings for each clinic, without account scares.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__res\"><p class=\"cmwk2__k\">Results achieved</p><ul role=\"list\"><li><b>+82%</b><span>booked consultations</span></li><li><b>0</b><span>suspensions since</span></li><li><b>−28%</b><span>cost per booking</span></li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t</article><article class=\"cmwk2__panel cmwk2__panel--3\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"bw-339-packwise\" aria-labelledby=\"bw-339-t-packwise\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden>\n\t\t\t\t\t<header class=\"cmwk2__head\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Packwise Supplies</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Packaging, eCommerce and Amazon · 50 people · 12 months with us</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"cmwk2__tags\" role=\"list\"><li>Amazon Ads</li><li>Google Shopping</li><li>Microsoft Ads</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t</header>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__grid\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__col cmwk2__col--why\"><p class=\"cmwk2__k\">Why they came to us</p><p>Amazon sales were growing, but advertising ate most of the margin.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__col cmwk2__col--did\"><p class=\"cmwk2__k\">The work we did</p><ul class=\"cmwk2__did\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Amazon Sponsored Products restructured by margin</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Google Shopping for the website</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Microsoft Ads for business buyers</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> One report across all three</li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__col cmwk2__col--exp\"><p class=\"cmwk2__k\">The outcome they wanted</p><p>More profitable sales on Amazon and their own site.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__res\"><p class=\"cmwk2__k\">Results achieved</p><ul role=\"list\"><li><b>−36%</b><span>Amazon advertising cost of sales</span></li><li><b>+48%</b><span>website revenue</span></li><li><b>3</b><span>platforms, one report</span></li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
    "css": "b2b-performance-marketing",
    "modules": [
     "@intella/tabs"
    ]
   }
